    "description": "Objective\n\nAdd a visual Path component to the Sign-Up and Player record pages, tied to their respective status fields, for at-a-glance progress tracking.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\nPath component on the Sign-Up record page tied to the Status field\n\nPath component on the Player record page tied to the Player Status field\n\nConfigure path steps to reflect the confirmed status values (pending BUILD-05 status matrix sign-off)\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\nBoth paths render on their record pages and update as status changes\n\nOpen Questions\n\nFinal status set (6 vs. 11 per BUILD-05) should be locked before finalizing path steps\n\n\\----------------------------------------\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~2h · Dependencies: BUILD-05, POC-10 · Ticket POC-19 (approved 2026-07-07)\n\nSource: Raised during internal POC review, 2026-07-07.",
