          "body": "Closing as Won't Do — superseded.\n\nTwo things overtook this ticket:\n\n1\\. The 2026-07-20 Sign-Up gap analysis decided against a Path component on the Sign-Up record page.\n\n2\\. BUILD-18 (Doc #17) changed the status set this Path was to be built against — Flagged was removed and fraud moved to Fraud Flag + Fraud Review Status.\n\nStatus visibility is now delivered via status emojis (BUILD-22) and the Console list view column set (BUILD-17).",
